# BetterArc Godot 4 Port — Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Port ArcCreate's Gameplay C# code to Godot 4 via mechanical copy + Unity API Shim, producing a fully playable Arcaea chart player.

**Architecture:** ArcCreate source files are copied verbatim into the Godot project. A `Shim/` layer provides `UnityEngine.*` namespace types that delegate to Godot APIs, allowing ArcCreate code to compile without modification. A thin `Integration/` layer wires Shim objects to actual Godot scene nodes. See `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-19-godot-port-design.md` for full spec.

**Tech Stack:** Godot 4.3+ (.NET), C# / .NET 8, MoonSharp (Lua, for Scenecontrol P3)

**Source:** `re/ArcCreate/Assets/Scripts/` (GPL-3.0 open-source, clean C#, not decompiled)

